## Top rule: construction kit

**Every building block must be usable in another app without being changed.** This outranks speed and convenience.

- Product-specific behaviour, theme and wording belong only in `apps/`.
- Project-specific workflow settings belong only in `project.config.json`.
- Before working on modules, read `{{MODULE_CONTRACT_PATH}}`. Machines enforce these rules in the project's check command.

